								<td class="mattersBttm">Signing of Boxer Protocol (Peace Agreement between China and the Great Powers) </td>
								<td class="materialBttm"><a href="../cha2/description24.html#c2241">KATSURA Taro Autobiography, Volume Three (Section on the Hokushin Incident)</a></td>
							</tr>
