								<td class="yearBttm">Meiji 35(1902)</td>
								<td class="dateBttm">January 30</td>
								<td class="mattersBttm">(1st) Anglo-Japanese Alliance agreement signed</td>
								<td class="materialBttm"><a href="../cha2/description25.html#c2251">Entente with the Great Britain and Germany, and the Russo-Japanese Alliance</a></td>
